{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-7-12","kind":"proposition","title":"性质与证明：比例与整数","englishTitle":"If there be as many numbers as we please in proportion, then, as one of the antecedents is to one of the consequents, so are all the antecedents to all the consequents.","book":7,"number":12,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:7.prop.12","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:7.prop.12/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":12,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-7-12@raw-a535a2397fadbf43","contentId":"euclid-7-12","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a535a2397fadbf4387c31b6812a123a852ea47e1bed8cb08b86b1c7eba454bd4","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-7-12.statement","euclid-7-12.construction.1","euclid-7-12.proof.1","euclid-7-12.proof.2","euclid-7-12.proof.3","euclid-7-12.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-7-12.statement","contentId":"euclid-7-12","revisionId":"euclid-7-12@raw-a535a2397fadbf43","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"3c96fe9e6802ee28a4bb0259406d1d26e723642db13cf848c2398d2eef260b9f","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"If there be as many numbers as we please in proportion, then, as one of the antecedents is to one of the consequents, so are all the antecedents to all the consequents."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果有我们想要的成比例的数字,那么,作为前例之一,所有后遗症的成比例数字也是前例。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-12.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-7-12","revisionId":"euclid-7-12@raw-a535a2397fadbf43","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"4f9fcd715ec57a3e221018c800af781ae8b80614e8e71cc02e49ff596f591d06","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let A, B, C, D be as many numbers as we please in proportion, so that, as A is to B, so is C to D; I say that, as A is to B, so are A, C to B, D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让A,B,C,D数目按我们所希望的比例计算,这样,A比B的比例等于C比D;我说,A比B,A比D；A 与 B 之比等于 C 与 D 之比。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-12.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-7-12","revisionId":"euclid-7-12@raw-a535a2397fadbf43","order":2,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"02f7e216727f4e728aa71ecaf562b2890560f51468b5a02eb852735d6e718c3b","citations":["euclid-7-def-20"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For since, as A is to B, so is C to D, whatever part or parts A is of B, the same part or parts is C of D also. [[VII. Def. 20](/principles/euclid-7-def-20)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"A对B的比等于C对D的比,而无论部分或部分为A的比为B,同一部分或部分为D的比为C；A 与 B 之比等于 C 与 D 之比。 [[VII. Def. 20](/principles/euclid-7-def-20)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-12.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-7-12","revisionId":"euclid-7-12@raw-a535a2397fadbf43","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"ac15253ef47c3f447fa24c4bf7289ba617870009a4ab8e6422f018c9c3656d4c","citations":["euclid-7-5"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore also the sum of A, C is the same part or the same parts of the sum of B, D that A is of B. [[VII. 5, 6](/principles/euclid-7-5)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,A,C的金额与B,D是B的金额相同部分或相同部分。 [[VII. 5, 6](/principles/euclid-7-5)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-12.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-7-12","revisionId":"euclid-7-12@raw-a535a2397fadbf43","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"af0f6a0684bde3aaf8c5b293c3aabede229f4bb89184ad9e63656dd30da724cf","citations":["euclid-7-def-20"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore, as A is to B, so are A, C to B, D. [[VII. Def. 20](/principles/euclid-7-def-20)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此，A 与 B 之比，等于 A、C 的总和与 B、D 的总和之比。 [[VII. Def. 20](/principles/euclid-7-def-20)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-12.source","contentId":"euclid-7-12","revisionId":"euclid-7-12@raw-a535a2397fadbf43","order":5,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"9fc9d44d499ba78c548ea41ec8493c4305542a6b7bb5bcdd5ff844c8b251cd50","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:7.prop.12/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:7.prop.12\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-7-12:euclid-7-def-20:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-7-12","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-7-12.proof.1","euclid-7-12.proof.3"],"targetContentId":"euclid-7-def-20","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:7.prop.12","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:7.prop.12/","sourceLabel":"VII. Def. 20"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-7-12:eucl